This vendored copy (talloc.c / talloc.h, taken from samba-talloc-2.4.2) is
provided so that LinuxDroid-PRoot builds are self-contained and do not require
a system libtalloc / pkg-config.  The accompanying `replace.h` is a
LinuxDroid-PRoot file that provides the small set of feature-detection macros
talloc expects from the Samba build system.

See https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html for the full license text.
